 "remarks": "Updated Stamford Townhouse - Now $3,475/Month!  Enjoy nearly 1,500 sq. ft. of living space across three finished levels in this bright, updated townhouse, tucked into a quiet community in a convenient Stamford location close to everything.  Features include: - Central air conditioning - Two reserved parking spaces, plus guest parking - In-unit washer and dryer - High ceilings and hardwood floors - Spacious living and dining area - Updated kitchen with access to a private deck overlooking the golf course - Two generously sized bedrooms with ample closet space - Fully finished lower level   Added value: Owner pays HOA fees, which include grounds maintenance, trash removal and water.  Enjoy convenient access to shopping, dining and everyday essentials, while coming home to a peaceful community.  Now offered at $3,475/month! More space, more convenience and more value than a typical two-bedroom apartment.",
